@SIGO_HostAddress = http://localhost:5044
@AccessToken = paste-jwt-token-here

### Health liveness - anonymous
GET {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

### Health readiness - anonymous, checks database connectivity
GET {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### Login as cliente - anonymous
POST {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "senha": "change-me"
}

###

### Direct cliente registration - no e-mail confirmation
POST {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes/cadastros
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "nome": "Cliente Exemplo",
  "email": "cliente@example.com",
  "senha": "Senha123"
}

###

### Full cliente registration and direct link - requires Oficina or Funcionario JWT with oficina_id claim
POST {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "nome": "Cliente Exemplo",
  "email": "cliente@example.com",
  "dataNasc": "1950-05-10",
  "sexo": 1,
  "numero": 120,
  "rua": "Rua das Flores",
  "cidade": "Blumenau",
  "cep": "89010-000",
  "bairro": "Centro",
  "estado": "SC",
  "pais": "Brasil",
  "complemento": "Casa",
  "telefones": [
    {
      "ddd": 47,
      "numero": "99999-9999"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Protected cliente lookup - requires JWT bearer token
GET {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Remove only this workshop's link to a cliente - requires Oficina JWT
DELETE {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/oficinas/me/clientes/6/vinculo
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Update a vehicle visible to the authenticated workshop - requires Oficina or Funcionario JWT
PUT {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/oficinas/me/veiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "nomeVeiculo": "Gol",
  "tipoVeiculo": "Hatch",
  "placaVeiculo": "ABC1D23",
  "chassiVeiculo": "9BWZZZ377VT004251",
  "anoFab": 2020,
  "quilometragem": 45000,
  "combustivel": "Flex",
  "seguro": "Sem seguro",
  "cor": "Prata"
}

###

### Delete a vehicle visible to the authenticated workshop - requires Oficina or Funcionario JWT
DELETE {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/oficinas/me/veiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Vehicle history as JSON - all authenticated roles, subject to access scope
GET {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/relatorios/veiculos/1/historico?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Create order - totals and unit prices are calculated by the backend
POST {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/pedidos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "idCliente": 7,
  "idFuncionario": 3,
  "idVeiculo": 7,
  "descontoPorcentagem": 5,
  "descontoServicoPorcentagem": 0,
  "descontoServicoReais": 0,
  "descontoPecaPorcentagem": 0,
  "descontoPecaReais": 10,
  "observacao": "Revisao",
  "dataInicio": "2026-08-03",
  "dataFim": "2026-08-20",
  "pedido_Pecas": [
    {
      "idPeca": 3,
      "quantidade": 1,
      "dataInstalacao": "2026-08-03",
      "estado": "Nova",
      "observacao": "Instalada durante a revisao"
    }
  ],
  "pedido_Servicos": [
    {
      "idServico": 5,
      "quantVezes": 2
    }
  ]
}

###

### Vehicle history as PDF
GET {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/relatorios/veiculos/1?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Vehicle history as Excel
GET {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/api/v1/relatorios/veiculos/1/excel?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### OpenAPI document - development environment only
GET {{SIGO_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
